{
  "_what": "The Calendar screen (src/workspace/shared-calendar-screen.tsx), as DATA: one calendar over every source src/calendar.json names, narrowed by the workspace's focus like every list. `calendar` is the one calendar view in the shared record views' bar (its id is the Calendar every list is offered, so the screen's own takes its place); `views` are the week, month and day its header offers (each a shared ScheduleCalendar view); `table` is the plain list of the same things. `place` names the focus dimension whose values are where a meeting can be put on (`param`, the pursuits), (the event forms, their words and the road that puts a meeting on for a space are calendar-event-forms.json). `members` is the road that says, while the focus is one pursuit, whose own calendar is connected there (`post`, `{space}` filled in) and where Connect your calendar goes (`connect`, the service's own sign-in, `{service}` filled in). `presence` is the view name the people looking at a focused pursuit's calendar share (src/board-room.mjs), so they see each other's cursors. `tray_side` sets which side the unplaced task pane occupies in the wide shared calendar. `hour_window`, `start_scroll_minute`, `snap_minutes` and `meeting_minutes` shape the hour lanes. `words` are every sentence the screen says; {title}, {when}, {count}, {place} and {source} are filled in.",
  "tray_side": "start",
